  "description": "Freeze is a crisp and energizing fragrance that blends fresh citrus with aromatic herbs and clean woody musk accords. The scent feels cool, modern, and refreshing, making it an easy everyday fragrance with a sporty masculine edge. The opening introduces bright citrus notes with fresh minty accords, creating a clean and invigorating first impression. The heart develops into lavender and aromatic herbs, adding smooth masculine freshness with a slightly green character. The base settles into musk, woods, and amber, leaving a clean, fresh, and long-lasting trail that feels crisp and versatile throughout the day. Freeze is perfect for men who enjoy fresh citrus aromatic fragrances with a cool modern style and easy daily wearability.",
